SMART BILLING SYSTEM
====================
Scan a paper bill (OCR), extract items, calculate the total and compare it
with the total printed on the paper. Saves bills to MySQL.

REQUIREMENTS
- Node.js 18 or newer
- MySQL 8 (running)
- Internet connection in the browser (Tesseract.js loads from a CDN)

SETUP
1. Open a terminal in this folder and run:   npm install
2. Copy .env.example to .env and put your MySQL password in it.
3. Create the database:   mysql -u root -p < schema.sql
   (Old database? Run:  ALTER TABLE bills ADD COLUMN notes VARCHAR(255);)
4. Start the server:   npm start
5. Open http://localhost:3000

HOW TO USE
1. Choose a bill image, click "Scan Bill", then "Extract Items".
2. Check every item, quantity and price in the table. Fix mistakes.
3. Enter the total printed on the paper. The app shows MATCH or MISMATCH.
4. Click "Save Bill". Saved bills appear under Billing History.

TIPS FOR BETTER OCR
- Use a straight, well-lit, sharp photo with no shadows.
- Crop to the bill only.
- OCR is never perfect: always verify the table before saving.

API
GET  /api/health   check server and database
POST /api/bills    save a bill {items:[{name,quantity,unitPrice}], paperTotal, notes}
GET  /api/bills    last 100 bills